atom_style granular
atom_modify map array
boundary f f f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
hard_particles yes
region dom block -0.05 0.05 -0.05 0.05 -0.05 0.05 units box
create_box 2 dom
neighbor 0.0005 bin
neigh_modify delay 0
fix p1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 380000000000.0 380000000000.0
fix p2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.23 0.23
fix p3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 2 0.98 0.98 0.98 0.98
fix p4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 2 0.092 0.092 0.092 0.092
pair_style gran model hertz tangential history
pair_coeff * *
fix w all wall/gran model hertz tangential history primitive type 1 zplane 0.0
create_atoms 1 single 0 0 0.0025010000000000002 units box
set atom * diameter 0.005 density 4000.0
set atom 1 vx 3.8407502367476112 vz -0.67722789290102858
timestep 5.7160860681832068e-08
fix integr all nve/sphere
compute om all property/atom omegay
compute oms all reduce sum c_om
variable vx1 equal vx[1]
variable vz1 equal vz[1]
thermo_style custom step v_vx1 v_vz1 c_oms
thermo_modify format float %.17g norm no
thermo 10
run 625
